{"summary":"A minimalist puzzle game that will knot your brain as it calms your soul.","description":"Deceptively simple. Infinitely complex. LYNE is a minimalist puzzle game that will knot your brain as it calms your soul.\n\nConnect the shapes. Fill the board. Lose yourself in the interflowing paths of LYNE.\n\n\"Lyne is a slick, contemplative puzzler that you'd be a fool to miss\" - PocketGamer, 9/10\n\nFeatures\n- Hundreds of pre-built puzzles\n- An infinite number of procedurally-generated puzzles, released daily\n- No in-app purchases. No ads.\n- Slick, intuitive interface\n- Soothing dynamic audio\n- Unlockable colour palettes\n\nAccolades\n- Finalist, IndieCade 2014\n- Best Puzzle Game, Tabby Awards 2014\n- Finalist for Audio Design at Freeplay 2013\n- Honorable Mention for Design at Freeplay 2013","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ulMWitiB2OQ?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SD7kRaXUEitJnt3n_Pm6HFd36bZrkeic2NK6NTTJE2zHcPtPX-JKDRRmcHprjxlyRmfffbbcsIwBqihXIYTGYyk","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8V2md326EdWUkpOylE6QzkGeHgheJb4FVvSrkuk1hJKYcG7KWeBTzCUGayr9WHSRUTOiL4mis_kPxmj2dZFuqw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JZoQ6jHHF2n6FuBtFXD7AnWKhkBwWMwid1pjqHIVIorOpZTyF4Z56VOs9ByOt1Kse5RaWOUS116n9blUYtrKkw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GKtzafeS-NWcxLhbAGpKirBYWNhFTxWmPCC6R9vGA5G6onYl2mRkd9Z62Gf6dU9e7q0H27pW4UBtufEzwWWutg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Ed5116qJ6W9WgqTJybQ671IN8lDhWP5yKJoFkVwrCjCn5pHRSHr0Iz7JNckchMEPx6g6KZTuw-IVkKLXe4XD","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tZii6M9G3GdfLaktl-LVEc4tt9sG43VfZSSGfE_9zS1ak7qHx9XdBHISXZnwOilHibKypURtTYxHQlB9RtrRxEM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IGpvDcN4m6dvXwLG5uD775oDu8yWpceZvMq4GCfDsTN3VJ2wswaNXqJg8Nxi-_tIp5WKFN6X0MFKLTod7hiR","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GVOySXdj1RIrGOEkzvEVOBthtuCVsNuC_dFXeX9sg6VzbGGCbDy5FaoL6qUSU7KEM0WqNW-EJxv46Lo8gtXNP7w","ht